<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ starts Interneuron.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ starts Interneuron.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette analyst Alex To said he initiated coverage of Interneuron Pharmaceuticals Inc, adding the stock to the firm's recommended list.</p>
<p>-- set $40 12-month price target on the stock.</p>
<p>-- said market had not fully appreciated the potential of Interneuron's citicoline stroke drug, which he said he believes will be approved by the second half of 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 2-1/4 to 19-3/4.</p>
</text>
